creature-cm5-sensors (0.3.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New binary package creature-cm5-revb-workarounds, for rev B boards only:
    a boot-time service that makes the character USB-C port offer 5 V only.
    The TPS25750 can't source 12 V (PPHV is sink-only), so a sink that
    asks for 12 V loops through hard resets.

 -- April White <april@opsnlops.io>  Mon, 16 Nov 2026 19:30:00 -0800

creature-cm5-sensors (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New binary package creature-cm5-audio: the board's PCM5122 line out as
    the ALSA card "Creature Analog Audio", using a simple-audio-card device
    tree overlay with only generic in-kernel drivers. Replaces (and on
    install disables) dtoverlay=allo-boss-dac-pcm512x-audio,slave.

 -- April White <april@opsnlops.io>  Mon, 16 Nov 2026 18:00:00 -0800

creature-cm5-sensors (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: PAC1954 hwmon driver (DKMS), device tree overlay for
    the Creature CM5 Carrier board's PAC1954 and MCP9808, sensors labels
    and MCP9808 limits.

 -- April White <april@opsnlops.io>  Mon, 16 Nov 2026 16:29:53 -0800
